------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party program: GoAlign
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product ships a compiled build of GoAlign, embedded in the SeqPanel
executable as `src-tauri/tools/goalign.exe` and unpacked at first launch.

    Project:   GoAlign
    Upstream:  https://github.com/evolbioinfo/goalign
    Version:   v0.4.1  (the binary is an unmodified build of that release;
               only the linker-injected version string was set, as upstream's
               own Makefile does)
    Author:    Frederic Lemoine and the GoAlign contributors
    Licence:   GNU General Public License, version 2
               (full text reproduced at LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt)

SeqPanel is a separate program. It never links against, imports or embeds
GoAlign source code: it starts GoAlign as an independent child process and
exchanges data over standard input and standard output. The two programs
therefore remain separate and independently licensed works, and the Apache
License 2.0 above applies only to SeqPanel's own sources.

GoAlign's source code corresponding to the bundled binary is available from the
upstream repository above, at the tag named there. No restriction is imposed on
recipients of GoAlign beyond the GNU GPL v2 under which upstream provides it.


------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Supported but not bundled: GoTree
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SeqPanel can drive any cobra-based command-line program, GoTree included, as
long as you point the panel at its executable. GoTree is distributed separately
under the GNU General Public License, version 2, by its own authors:

    https://github.com/choishingwan/GoTree

No copy of GoTree is included in this repository or in the released executable.


